  m_Name: case_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseData
  id: 1
  context: "THE GREEN MARKET SAFE ROBBED\nOn Saturday evening, after the closure
    of the supermarket Le March\xE9 Vert, the central cash register ($11,480 in cash)
    disappeared from the manager\u2019s office between 8:50 p.m. and 9:15 p.m. The
    safe was opened with the correct code, no break-in. The store was closed to the
    public since 8:30 p.m., but ten people (staff or suppliers) were still on site.
    The thief left through the back door with the money in a bag."
  facts: "Closed to the public: 8:30 p.m. \nIt has been raining since 8:45 p.m. \nBadge
    no. 7 used on the office door at 8:48 p.m. \nParking lot camera cut off at 8:52
    p.m. \nA man is filmed leaving through the back door at 9:04 p.m. with a blue
    sports bag \nThe gate of the delivery platform was slammed shut around 9:00 p.m."
  suspects:
